  "notes": "Phanpy Mastodon client profile route. Banner is a soft gradient landscape illustration fading to white; avatar is a gradient circle with initials overlapping the banner. Stats sit in a light gray rounded strip, with a 'View post stats' sub-strip using a multi-color mini bar icon. Pinned posts sit in a wider-than-column translucent panel; long pinned posts fade out with a centered 'Read more →' pill. Short posts in pinned cards render at larger font size. Timeline posts are white 16px-radius cards with small red heart markers in the top-right for favourited posts. Filter row uses pill-wrapped native checkboxes. Live check: toggling Replies shows a transient 'Showing replies' toast and writes ?replies=1 to the URL. The DOM also contains a hidden home timeline behind the profile route (not visible in the capture)."
